# Trial of the Seeker (Q213), a second class-change trial, played by a level 36 Rogue, every
# script roll pinned to 0: Dufner starts it with his letter and pays the level 35 set's
# Dimensional Diamonds (128 for a Rogue, once per character); Terry sends the rogue after the
# Neer Ghoul Berserker's runestone, then the four captains' runestones; Viktor, Terry and
# Viktor again trade letters for the request of ten Medusa scales; Marina, Brunon and Marina
# analyse the Shilen runestone; Terry, the level 36 rogue needing no third order, lists the
# hosts of the four abyss runestones and writes his report; Dufner hands over the Mark of
# Seeker and completes the quest; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this
# scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q213_trial_of_the_seeker.golden
character Seeker 36
class 7
random always 0
script quest.Q213_TrialOfTheSeeker
item 2647 2648 2649 2650 2651 2652 2653 2654 2655 2656 2657 2658 2659 2660 2661 2662 2663 2664 2665 2666 2667 2668 2669 2670 2671 2672 2673 7562
page trainer/30106.htm
page trainer/30064.htm
page trainer/30526.htm
page merchant/30684.htm
page trainer/30715.htm
page script/quest/Q213_TrialOfTheSeeker/
npc dufner 30106 Trainer 10 0 0
npc terry 30064 Trainer -10 0 0
